
note <lower a `test <phrase>` block to the `test` meta object: its name is the phrase, its work is the body's flow wrapped as a task. `run` (in @term/seed/code/test) executes a list of these. No special compiler support: a milled `test` is an ordinary record the backend emits like any other.>

mint test
  case name
    site name
  case work, mint flow
    site work
  hook make
    make test
      bind name, read name
      bind work, read work
